<title>SWEDEN: Sweden issues 7-yr 400 mln NOK structured note.</title>
<headline>Sweden issues 7-yr 400 mln NOK structured note.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kingdom of Sweden will issue a seven-year structured note for 400 million Norwegian crowns, the issue's lead manager Pareto Fonds AS said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Pareto Fonds gave no other information about the issue.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
